window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Reborn love. Unleashed magic. We won't fail twice.</b></p> <p>Hi, I'm Kit. Immortal vampire and technomage extraordinaire. You know how it goes.</p> <p>For the record, I am absolutely not stalking my reincarnated husband.</p> <p>Okay, I am, but it's for his own good. And mine. Er, assuming I can somehow figure out how to tell him he's reincarnated and a mage, and we all live in a sentient library.</p> <p>Any thoughts on that? I'm currently taking suggestions.</p> <p>One thing's for sure. He's not dying on me again. Never again.</p>"; 
